  "description": "Ten years ago, Ines was commissioned to paint the portrait of the wayward prince of Vertone Kingdom. Fast forward to present day, Ines is taken prisoner by Nathan, leader of the revolutionary party, who demands that she draw a portrait of this elusive prince as she remembers him. As Ines protests, the tension between them escalates and Nathan desires more than just a painting from her.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
